{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Unit 15\u30fb\u8a9e\u5f59\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\uff0825\u500b\uff09<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:77.16%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:31.66%;\"><col style=\"width:31.78%;\"><col style=\"width:36.56%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u3053\u3068\u3070<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u6f22\u5b57<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u30d9\u30c8\u30ca\u30e0\u8a9e<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u305b\u3093\u3082\u3093<\/td><td>\u5c02\u9580<\/td><td>chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3058\u3087\u3046\u307b\u3046\u3053\u3046\u304c\u304f<\/td><td>\u60c5\u5831\u5de5\u5b66<\/td><td>k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt th\u00f4ng tin<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u305d\u3064\u304e\u3087\u3046\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u5352\u696d\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>t\u1ed1t nghi\u1ec7p<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3059\u3059\u307f\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u9032\u307f\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>h\u1ecdc l\u00ean<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3089\u3044<\/td><td>\u5c06\u6765<\/td><td>t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3058\u3087\u3046\u307b\u3046\u3064\u3046\u3057\u3093<\/td><td>\u60c5\u5831\u901a\u4fe1<\/td><td>c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 th\u00f4ng tin<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u306f\u304b\u305b\u304b\u3066\u3044<\/td><td>\u535a\u58eb\u8ab2\u7a0b<\/td><td>kh\u00f3a h\u1ecdc ti\u1ebfn s\u0129<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u306f\u304b\u305b\u3054\u3046<\/td><td>\u535a\u58eb\u53f7<\/td><td>b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfn s\u0129<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh, tr\u1edf n\u00ean<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3057\u3085\u3046\u3057\u3087\u304f\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u5c31\u8077\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>xin vi\u1ec7c<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u304d\u3081\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u6c7a\u3081\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u304b\u3093\u3051\u3044<\/td><td>\u95a2\u4fc2<\/td><td>quan h\u1ec7, li\u00ean quan<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u30a8\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30c6\u30a4\u30f3\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3042\u3089\u308f\u308c\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>g\u1eb7p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ai \u0111\u00f3<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u305f\u3076\u3093<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>c\u00f3 l\u1ebd<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3064\u3065\u3051\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u7d9a\u3051\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u3053\u3046\u304c\u304f<\/td><td>\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u5de5\u5b66<\/td><td>k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3052\u3093\u3054\u308a\u304b\u3044<\/td><td>\u8a00\u8a9e\u7406\u89e3<\/td><td>hi\u1ec3u ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u306b\u3093\u3052\u3093<\/td><td>\u4eba\u9593<\/td><td>con ng\u01b0\u1eddi<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u30b3\u30df\u30e5\u30cb\u30b1\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>giao ti\u1ebfp<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u30ed\u30dc\u30c3\u30c8<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>r\u00f4 b\u1ed1t<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3057\u3093\u304c\u304f\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u9032\u5b66\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>h\u1ecdc l\u00ean cao<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3042\u3044\u3066<\/td><td>\u76f8\u624b<\/td><td>\u0111\u1ed1i ph\u01b0\u01a1ng, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3058\u3087\u305b\u3044<\/td><td>\u5973\u6027<\/td><td>ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u304b\u3058<\/td><td>\u5bb6\u4e8b<\/td><td>vi\u1ec7c nh\u00e0<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3044\u304f\u3058<\/td><td>\u80b2\u5150<\/td><td>nu\u00f4i d\u1ea1y con<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><strong>Unit 15\u30fb\u6587\u578b\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8<\/strong><br>&nbsp;<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:66.29%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p><strong>\uff0aC\u00e1c k\u00fd hi\u1ec7u c\u1ea7n l\u01b0u \u00fd:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><p><i>N: danh t\u1eeb&nbsp;<\/i><\/p><p><i>V: \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb<\/i> (V\u308b\u30fbV\u305f\u30fbV\u306a\u3044\u30fbV\u3066\u30fbV<s>\u307e\u3059<\/s> (\u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb th\u1ec3 masu b\u1ecf masu))&nbsp;<\/p><p>Adj: t\u00ednh t\u1eeb (Adj\u306a: t\u00ednh t\u1eeb \u0111u\u00f4i na\uff0fAdj\u3044: t\u00ednh t\u1eeb \u0111u\u00f4i i) =&gt; (Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>: t\u00ednh t\u1eeb \u0111u\u00f4i na b\u1ecf na\uff0fAdj<s>\u3044<\/s>: t\u00ednh t\u1eeb \u0111u\u00f4i i b\u1ecf i)&nbsp;<\/p><p>Adv: ph\u00f3 t\u1eeb<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>A. <u>M\u1eabu ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p ch\u00ednh<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>1. \u301c\u3064\u3082\u308a\u3067\u3059<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:46.87%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u56fd\u3078\u5e30\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3001\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u306e\u52c9\u5f37\u3092\u3064\u3065\u3051\u308b<strong><u>\u3064\u3082\u308a\u3067\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">(D\u00f9 v\u1ec1 n\u01b0\u1edbc t\u00f4i \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1eabn ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c h\u1ecdc ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt.)<\/p><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u660e\u65e5\u304b\u3089\u306f\u30bf\u30d0\u30b3\u3092\u5438\u308f\u306a\u3044<strong><u>\u3064\u3082\u308a\u3067\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">(T\u00f4i \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1eeb mai s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng h\u00fat thu\u1ed1c l\u00e1 n\u1eefa.)<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:&nbsp;<\/u><\/p><p><strong>\u0110\u1ecbnh l\u00e0\u2026, d\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ebd\u2026<\/strong><\/p><p>D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 di\u1ec5n \u0111\u1ea1t \u00fd \u0111\u1ecbnh l\u00e0m ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3.&nbsp;<\/p><p><u>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/u><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:24.96%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>V\u308b\u30fbV\u306a\u3044\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3064\u3082\u308a\u3067\u3059<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p><strong>2. \u666e\u901a\u5f62\uff08\u3075\u3064\u3046\u3051\u3044\uff09<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong><\/p><p><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:&nbsp;<\/u><\/p><ul><li>C\u00e2u v\u0103n c\u1ee7a ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt c\u00f3 2 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 th\u1ec3 l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1 v\u00e0 th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Trong h\u1ed9i tho\u1ea1i, th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00f9ng v\u1edbi b\u1ea1n th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p, gia \u0111\u00ecnh.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Trong v\u0103n vi\u1ebft, th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 vi\u1ebft lu\u1eadn v\u0103n, b\u00e1o c\u00e1o, nh\u1eadt k\u00fd,...<\/li><\/ul><p><u>b. C\u00e1ch chia:<\/u><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:47.57%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:49.14%;\"><col style=\"width:50.86%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Th\u1ec3 l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3067\u3059<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3060<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3058\u3083\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3067\u3057\u305f<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3060\u3063\u305f<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3058\u3083\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305f<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3058\u3083\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">Adj\u3044\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3067\u3059<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">Adj\u3044\u3000\uff0b\u3000<s>\u3067\u3059<\/s><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">Adj<s>\u3044<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u304f\u306a\u3044\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3067\u3059<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">Adj<s>\u3044<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u304f\u306a\u3044\u3000\uff0b\u3000<s>\u3067\u3059<\/s><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">Adj<s>\u3044<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3067\u3059<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">Adj<s>\u3044<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3000\uff0b\u3000<s>\u3067\u3059<\/s><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">Adj<s>\u3044<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u304f\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3067\u3059<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">Adj<s>\u3044<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u304f\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3000\uff0b\u3000<s>\u3067\u3059<\/s><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">V\u307e\u3059<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">V\u308b<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">V\u307e\u305b\u3093<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">V\u306a\u3044<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">V\u307e\u3057\u305f<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">V\u305f<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">V\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305f<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">V\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><ul><li>C\u00e2u nghi v\u1ea5n \u1edf th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 \u201c\u304b\u201d, thay v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 s\u1ebd d\u00f9ng d\u1ea5u \u201c?\u201d.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Khi n\u00f3i l\u00ean gi\u1ecdng \u1edf cu\u1ed1i c\u00e2u. Danh t\u1eeb v\u00e0 t\u00ednh t\u1eeb \u0111u\u00f4i na b\u1ecf lu\u00f4n \u201c\u3060\u201d .<\/li><\/ul><p><i><u>V\u00ed d\u1ee5<\/u><\/i>: &nbsp; \u30b3\u30fc\u30d2\u30fc\u3092\u306e\u3080\uff1f\uff08U\u1ed1ng c\u00e0 ph\u00ea kh\u00f4ng?\uff09<\/p><p>\u3053\u3093\u3070\u3093\u3001\u3072\u307e\uff1f\uff08T\u1ed1i nay r\u1ea3nh kh\u00f4ng?\uff09<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><br><strong>3.<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>3.1. \u301c\u3068\u601d\uff08\u304a\u3082\uff09\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:29.64%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li>\u660e\u65e5\u96e8\u304c\u3075\u308b<strong><u>\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;(T\u00f4i ngh\u0129 ng\u00e0y mai tr\u1eddi s\u1ebd m\u01b0a.)<\/p><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li>\u65e5\u672c\u306f\u7269\u4fa1\uff08\u3076\u3063\u304b\uff09\u304c\u9ad8\u3044<strong><u>\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(T\u00f4i ngh\u0129 gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a Nh\u1eadt \u0111\u1eaft \u0111\u1ecf.)<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:&nbsp;<\/u><\/p><p><strong>T\u00f4i ngh\u0129 l\u00e0 \u2026.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><p>D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ec3u th\u1ecb s\u1ef1 ph\u1ecfng \u0111o\u00e1n ho\u1eb7c b\u00e0y t\u1ecf \u00fd ki\u1ebfn.<\/p><p><u>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/u><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:24.86%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u3075\u3064\u3046\u5f62\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>3.2. \u301c\u3060\u308d\u3046\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:42.56%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li>\u305f\u3076\u3093\u3053\u306e\u96e8\u306f1\u6642\u9593\u3050\u3089\u3044\u3067\u3084\u3080<strong><u>\u3060\u308d\u3046\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">(T\u00f4i ngh\u0129 ch\u1eafc l\u00e0 m\u01b0a s\u1ebd t\u1ea1nh trong kho\u1ea3ng 1 ti\u1ebfng n\u1eefa.)<\/p><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li>\u5916\u56fd\u3067\u4e00\u4eba\u66ae\uff08\u3050\uff09\u3089\u3057\u306e\u306f\u3055\u3073\u3057\u3044<strong><u>\u3060\u308d\u3046\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">(T\u00f4i ngh\u0129 s\u1ed1ng 1 m\u00ecnh \u1edf n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i ch\u1eafc l\u00e0 c\u00f4 \u0111\u01a1n l\u1eaf.)<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/u><\/p><p><strong>T\u00f4i ngh\u0129 l\u00e0 ch\u1eafc\u2026&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><p>D\u00f9ng khi truy\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea1t v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec1u b\u1ea1n ngh\u0129 c\u00f3 l\u1ebd l\u00e0 nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u1eafc l\u1eafm.&nbsp;<\/p><p><u>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/u><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:30.14%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u3075\u3064\u3046\u5f62\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3060\u308d\u3046\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>3.3. \u301c\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:49.36%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li>28\u6b73\uff08\u3055\u3044\uff09\u304f\u3089\u3044\u306b\u306f\u7d50\u5a5a\uff08\u3051\u3063\u3053\u3093\uff09\u3059\u308b<strong><u>\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;(T\u00f4i ngh\u0129 ch\u1eafc l\u00e0 s\u1ebd k\u1ebft h\u00f4n v\u00e0o n\u0103m 28 tu\u1ed5i)<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/u><i>&nbsp;<\/i><\/p><p><strong>T\u00f4i ngh\u0129 ch\u1eafc l\u00e0 \u2026.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><p>C\u00e1ch n\u00f3i n\u00eau l\u00ean suy ngh\u0129, ph\u00e1n \u0111o\u00e1n c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch kh\u00e1ch quan th\u01b0\u1eddng d\u00f9ng trong h\u1ed9i tho\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y.<\/p><p><u>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/u><\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:43.68%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u3075\u3064\u3046\u5f62\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i><strong>\uff08\uff0a\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi N\/Adj\u306a \u2192 th\u00eam \u306a tr\u01b0\u1edbc <\/strong><\/i><strong>\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059<\/strong><i><strong>\uff09<\/strong><\/i><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>4. \u301c\u304b\u3082\u3057\u308c\u307e\u305b\u3093<\/strong><\/p><figure